{{! Default navbar menu items.

This theme keeps no knowledge of any particular site's structure. It renders one
top-level link per Antora component (content source), derived from `site.components`.
Each component exposes `name`, `title`, and `url` (an already root-relative URL
to its start page), so `relativize` is all that's needed for the href.

A consuming site that wants control over labels, order, or extra links,
overrides this partial by shipping its own `partials/nav-menu.hbs`
via the playbook's `supplemental_files`. A supplemental partial replaces
the one baked into the UI bundle.}}

{{#each site.components}}
  <li><a href="{{{relativize this.url}}}">{{this.title}}</a></li>
{{/each}}
